ops.argument	Match the arguments to the operation in `foundation docs`
ops.unknown-operation	Use a name from `foundation docs`
ops.input	Give standard input a source that can be read
ops.output	Give standard output a destination that can be written
ops.bad-plan	Make a plan with `foundation plan`, and apply it with no edits
ops.behind	Fix the cause, then plan again
ops.stale-plan	Plan again
ops.apply	Fix the cause in the message, then plan and apply again
ops.stopped	Fix the cause in the message, then start the node and plan again
ops.unknown-extension	Use a file that ends in `.hcl`
ops.path-not-utf8	Rename the file to a UTF-8 name
